          "text": " <!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>鞋底与钥匙｜街口修补站</title>\n<style>\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@400;700;900&family=Martian+Mono:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;700;900&display=swap');\n:root{--red:#C1121F;--paper:#EFE7D7;--ink:#1A1614;--lead:#6E6A5E;--gap:24px;}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:0;}\nhtml{background:var(--paper);}\nbody{margin:0;background-color:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:'Noto Sans SC','Source Han Sans SC',sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.42;overflow-x:hidden;}\nbody:before{content:\"\";position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,var(--paper) 0,var(--paper) 5px,var(--lead) 5px,var(--lead) 6px);background-size:100% 17px;mix-blend-mode:multiply;opacity:.075;z-index:10;}\n.page{position:relative;max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 40px 32px;overflow:hidden;}\n.masthead{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:5fr 4fr 4fr 3fr;column-gap:var(--gap);min-height:108px;border-bottom:3px solid var(--ink);align-items:end;padding-bottom:12px;}\n.kicker{grid-column:1/3;font-family:'Archivo','Noto Sans SC',sans-serif;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:15px;}\n.issue{grid-column:4;text-align:right;font-family:'Martian Mono',monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:12px;line-height:1.2;}\n.issue strong{font-size:19px;display:block;}\n.rule-note{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:100%;font-family:'Martian Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:var(--lead);letter-spacing:.03em;}\n.red-wedge{position:absolute;z-index:0;background:var(--red);width:71%;height:124px;left:-10%;top:104px;transform:skewX(-11deg) rotate(-11deg);transform-origin:left center;}\n.red-wedge:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;right:-20px;top:0;width:20px;height:100%;background:var(--red);}\n.content-grid{position:relative;z-index:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:5fr 4fr 4fr 3fr;column-gap:var(--gap);align-items:start;padding-top:18px;}\n.col{min-width:0;}\n.lead-col{padding-top:54px;}\n.empty-news{height:58px;margin-bottom:8px;position:relative;border-top:1px solid var(--lead);}\n.empty-news:before{content:\"\";position:absolute;top:25px;left:50%;width:6px;height:6px;background:var(--lead);transform:translateX(-50%);}\n.empty-news span{position:absolute;left:0;top:2px;font-family:'Martian Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;color:var(--lead);}\nh1{font-size:clamp(64px,7vw,96px);line-height:.88;letter-spacing:-.085em;margin:0 0 18px;font-weight:900;max-width:5.3em;position:relative;}\n.deck{font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;max-width:23em;margin:0 0 22px;border-left:3px solid var(--ink);padding-left:12px;}\n.cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);border:3px solid var(--ink);padding:11px 15px 10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.04em;position:relative;}\n.cta:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;bottom:-7px;width:100%;height:3px;background:var(--red);}\n.section-label{font-family:'Martian Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;border-bottom:3px solid var(--red);padding-bottom:6px;margin-bottom:14px;position:relative;display:inline-block;}\n.section-label:hover:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;bottom:-3px;height:3px;width:100%;background:var(--red);animation:label-jump 90ms steps(3) both;}\n@keyframes label-jump{from{width:0}to{width:100%}}\n.story{border-top:1px solid var(--ink);padding-top:10px;margin-bottom:18px;position:relative;}\n.story:nth-of-type(odd){padding-right:10px;}\n.story h2{font-size:22px;line-height:1.08;margin:0 0 7px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.04em;}\n.story p{margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;}\n.num{font-family:'Martian Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;text-align:right;display:block;margin-bottom:4px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}\n.photo{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:3px solid var(--ink);object-fit:cover;margin:0 0 10px;filter:grayscale(1) contrast(1.15);}\n.photo-caption{font-family:'Martian Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;line-height:1.25;color:var(--lead);margin:0 0 16px;}\n.image-block{border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink);padding-bottom:12px;margin-bottom:16px;}\n.text-image{height:156px;border:3px solid var(--ink);padding:12px;background:var(--paper);display:flex;align-items:end;margin-bottom:10px;}\n.text-image b{font-size:28px;line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.06em;}\n.fold{position:relative;border:3px solid var(--ink);padding:13px 13px 15px;background:var(--paper);margin-top:10px;cursor:pointer;}\n.fold:before{content:\"\";position:absolute;right:-3px;top:-3px;width:30px;height:30px;background:var(--red);clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 0,100% 100%);}\n.fold:after{content:\"↗\";position:absolute;right:4px;top:1px;color:var(--paper);font-size:18px;font-family:'Archivo','Noto Sans SC',sans-serif;}\n.fold summary{list-style:none;font-weight:900;font-size:18px;line-height:1.05;padding-right:20px;}\n.fold summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}\n.fold p{font-size:14px;margin:10px 0 0;}\n.latin{font-family:'Archivo','Noto Sans SC',sans-serif;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.02em;text-transform:uppercase;}\n.footer{display:grid;grid-template-columns:5fr 4fr 4fr 3fr;column-gap:var(--gap);border-top:3px solid var(--ink);margin-top:6px;padding-top:11px;font-size:12px;}\n.footer p{margin:0}.footer .latin{font-size:12px}.footer .phone{grid-column:4;text-align:right;font-family:'Martian Mono',monospace;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;}\n.reveal{animation:drop-in 320ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.15,1) both;animation-delay:calc(var(--i)*60ms);}\n@keyframes drop-in{from{transform:translateY(-12px)}to{transform:translateY(0)}}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.reveal{animation:fade-in 120ms ease both;animation-delay:0!important}.red-wedge{transform:skewX(-11deg) rotate(-11deg)}}\n@keyframes fade-in{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n@media (max-width:850px){.page{padding:18px 18px 25px}.masthead,.content-grid,.footer{grid-template-columns:1fr;column-gap:0}.masthead{min-height:120px}.kicker{grid-column:1}.issue{grid-column:1;text-align:left;margin-top:12px}.red-wedge{top:116px;left:-20%;width:115%;height:100px}.content-grid{padding-top:14px}.lead-col{padding-top:48px}h1{font-size:clamp(60px,18vw,86px)}.col{padding-top:18px;border-top:24px solid var(--paper)}.footer{border-top:3px solid var(--ink);gap:11px}.footer .phone{grid-column:1;text-align:left}.photo{max-width:100%}.empty-news{height:58px}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n<header class=\"masthead\">\n<div class=\"rule-note\">街口记录 / 03—24—2025 / NO.017</div>\n<div class=\"kicker\">NORTHSTAR SHOE + KEY / 现场修补部</div>\n<div class=\"issue\"><strong>017</strong>今天也开门<br>雨天照样配钥匙</div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"red-wedge\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<section class=\"content-grid\" aria-label=\"街口修补服务\">\n<article class=\"col lead-col reveal\" style=\"--i:0\">\n<div class=\"empty-news\"><span>未刊 / NEWS THAT GOT PUSHED OUT</span></div>\n<h1>鞋底<br>别硬撑。</h1>\n<p class=\"deck\">鞋跟响了、钥匙卡了、拉链跟你闹脾气了？拿来。我们在街角把小麻烦修回能用。</p>\n<a class=\"cta\" href=\"tel:01055550177\">打电话，约时间 →</a>\n<div class=\"image-block\" style=\"margin-top:28px\">\n<img class=\"photo\" src=\"images/占位-1.jpg\" width=\"540\" height=\"390\" alt=\"工作台上的鞋底与工具\">\n<p class=\"photo-caption\">01 / 台面不漂亮，活儿要漂亮。</p>\n</div>\n<details class=\"fold\"><summary>折角导读：今天先修哪一件？</summary><p>先把最急的说出来。上班要穿的鞋、今晚要开的门、明早要交的钥匙，我们按时间排，不按脸色排。</p></details>\n</article>\n<article class=\"col reveal\" style=\"--i:1\">\n<div class=\"section-label\">01 / 鞋底急救</div>\n<div class=\"story\"><span class=\"num\">01</span><h2>鞋跟不该替你发言。</h2><p>走三步响一声，整条街都知道你来了。换底、补口、钉跟，别让鞋替你喊救命。</p></div>\n<div class=\"image-block\"><img class=\"photo\" src=\"images/占位-2.jpg\" width=\"420\" height=\"300\" alt=\"正在修补的皮鞋\"><p class=\"photo-caption\">修补现场 / 先看磨损，再动刀。</p></div>\n<div class=\"story\"><span class=\"num\">02</span><h2>皮面刮花？别急着扔。</h2><p>颜色能找回来，边角能收住。旧鞋有旧鞋的脾气，我们不把它修成陌生人。</p></div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"col reveal\" style=\"--i:2\">\n<div class=\"section-label\">02 / 钥匙与门</div>\n<div class=\"image-block\"><img class=\"photo\" src=\"images/占位-3.jpg\" width=\"420\" height=\"350\" alt=\"钥匙坯与配钥匙机器\"><p class=\"photo-caption\">钥匙位 / 一把对，一整天顺。</p></div>\n<div class=\"story\"><span class=\"num\">03</span><h2>卡住的门，不等于卡住的日子。</h2><p>家门、储物柜、老抽屉。带原钥匙最好，没有也别慌，先来电话说清楚。</p></div>\n<div class=\"story\"><span class=\"num\">04</span><h2>多配一把，少跑一趟。</h2><p>给室友、给爸妈、给那个总忘带钥匙的人。现场试开，不让你回家才发现不对。</p></div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"col reveal\" style=\"--i:3\">\n<div class=\"section-label\">03 / 小修小补</div>\n<div class=\"image-block\"><img class=\"photo\" src=\"images/占位-4.jpg\" width=\"320\" height=\"300\" alt=\"修鞋店门口的工具与布料\"><p class=\"photo-caption\">门口 / 工具比招牌更会说话。</p></div>\n<div class=\"story\"><span class=\"num\">05</span><h2>拉链、扣子、包角，能救就救。</h2><p>我们不卖“换新的比较快”。能补的先补，能撑的再撑，东西跟人一样，值得多一轮。</p></div>\n<div class=\"text-image\"><b>来之前<br>先打个电话。</b></div>\n<p class=\"photo-caption\">05 / 预约不是排场，是让你不用白跑。</p>\n</article>\n</section>\n<footer class=\"footer\">\n<p class=\"latin\">OPEN WHEN THE STREET IS AWAKE</p>\n<p>周一至周六 09:30—19:30<br>周日看雨势，电话确认</p>\n<p>北京 · 北站口 · 红砖巷 7 号<br>进巷第二个卷帘门</p>\n<p class=\"phone\">010 5555 0177</p>\n</footer>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
        }
      }
    }
  },
